{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Combat Shooter is a first-person shooter where you battle for survival in a house that stands as humanity\u2019s final stronghold. Zombies from various eras and dimensions pour in through time portals.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IN THIS DEMO, YOU GET:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 locations with unique layouts and defensive routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 types of weapons \u2014 from melee to firearms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting system: create ammo and upgrade your weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First steps in building the time machine \u2014 limited parts available</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three skins for each weapon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical base defense: fortify entrances, gather resources, and hold off enemy waves</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEMO VERSION LIMITATIONS:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only a portion of the content is available: 5 out of 41 locations, 20 out of 60+ weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited game modes: survival challenges, Roguelike mode, and daily missions are not included</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration is restricted: not all secrets and hidden areas can be accessed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some base features and environment interactions are disabled</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress made in the demo does <strong>not</strong> carry over to the full game</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3818620?t=1762781940","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3818620?t=1762781940","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818620/8c0a4bcdf1c24acbdbb13bb6c808ce19bcec098f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762781940","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818620/8c0a4bcdf1c24acbdbb13bb6c808ce19bcec098f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762781940","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Combat Shooter is a first-person shooter where you battle for survival in a house that stands as humanity\u2019s final stronghold. Zombies from various eras and dimensions pour in through time portals.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IN THIS DEMO, YOU GET:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 locations with unique layouts and defensive routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 types of weapons \u2014 from melee to firearms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting system: create ammo and upgrade your weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First steps in building the time machine \u2014 limited parts available</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three skins for each weapon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical base defense: fortify entrances, gather resources, and hold off enemy waves</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEMO VERSION LIMITATIONS:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only a portion of the content is available: 5 out of 41 locations, 20 out of 60+ weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited game modes: survival challenges, Roguelike mode, and daily missions are not included</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration is restricted: not all secrets and hidden areas can be accessed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some base features and environment interactions are disabled</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress made in the demo does <strong>not</strong> carry over to the full game</p></li></ul>","develo